package UnaryIndividuals

// These examples correspond to 01-Individual.mermaid (Unary branch)

// Category: Concrete substantial individual
// Example: John
// In Tonto, we model the type 'Person' that John is an instance of.
kind Person

// Category: Abstract individual (Value)
// Example: $10.00
// In Tonto, we model the datatype 'CurrencyAmount'
datatype CurrencyAmount

// Category: Moment individual
// Example: Mary's patience
// In Tonto, we model the quality 'Patience' that inheres in 'Person'.
quality Patience
@characterization
relation Patience [1] -- inheresIn -- [1] Person

// Category: Perdurant individual
// Example: John and Mary's wedding ceremony
// In Tonto, we model the event type 'WeddingCeremony'
// that individual weddings (like John and Mary's wedding) instantiate.
event WeddingCeremony

// Category: Situation individual
// Example: Sunrise being understaffed
// In Tonto, we model the situation type 'UnderstaffedSituation'
// that can hold of a BreakfastPlace such as Sunrise.
situation UnderstaffedSituation
